]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/12/business/economy/america-new-cities-irvine.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:00:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>It’s a Grocery Store, but Selling Food Isn’t the Point</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/12/business/happier-grocery.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
