]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/12/business/happier-grocery.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 06:54:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Bans on Many CBD Products Loom This Year</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/12/health/bans-on-many-cbd-products-loom-this-year.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/02/10/multimedia/00HS-HEMP-05-bctm/00HS-HEMP-05-bctm-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" alt="Article image"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
