]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/12/health/bans-on-many-cbd-products-loom-this-year.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:00:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Laid-Off Battery Plant Workers Pin Blame on Ford, not Trump, for Lost Jobs</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/12/business/energy-environment/ford-trump-electric-vehicles-kentucky.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
