&lt;p&gt;Ford Motor shut down a battery factory and laid off 1,600 workers after President Trump and Republicans gutted government support for electric vehicles.&lt;/p&gt;
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/12/business/energy-environment/ford-trump-electric-vehicles-kentucky.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2026 01:02:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>New Method Can Find Hidden Eggs to Aid in Fertility Treatment</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/12/health/ivf-hidden-eggs-device-ovaready.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
